[00:17.40]Nations are troubled as never before.
[00:23.34]People are fearful of what lies in store.
[00:29.71]Firm and immovable we need to be,
[00:36.20]Serving our God faithfully.
[00:42.57](Chorus)
[00:42.72]Steadfast we all need to be;
[00:48.32]Far from this world we keep free,
[00:55.78]Standing firm to the end,
[01:00.28]Unending life we’ll see.
[01:18.76]Snares of the world and temptations abound.
[01:24.78]We can resist if our thinking is sound.
[01:31.50]Hating what’s bad while we love what is true
[01:37.82]Makes us immovable too.
[01:44.11](Chorus)
[01:44.26]Steadfast we all need to be;
[01:49.90]Far from this world we keep free,
[01:57.08]Standing firm to the end,
[02:01.96]Unending life we’ll see.
[02:23.70]Give to God worship that comes from the heart.
[02:29.90]In the Lord’s service may we have a part.
[02:36.46]Preach the good news, always holding it fast.
[02:42.78]Soon the last days will have passed.
[02:48.22](Chorus)
[02:48.37]Steadfast we all need to be;
[02:55.94]Far from this world we keep free,
[03:02.19]Standing firm to the end,
[03:07.30]Unending life we’ll see.
